---
<section class="point-section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title-en">POINT</h2>
    <div class="point-grid">
      <div class="point-card glass-card">
        <h3>理性が崩れていく恋</h3>
        <p>冷静で理知的な男が、少しずつ恋に呑まれていく過程。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="point-card glass-card">
        <h3>知性で惹かれ合う関係性</h3>
        <p>尊敬と執着が恋へ変わる、知的共鳴型BL。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="point-card glass-card">
        <h3>年下執着攻め</h3>
        <p>明るく見えて危うい、迷いのない一途な愛。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="point-card glass-card">
        <h3>傷を抱えた大人の再生譚</h3>
        <p>感情を抑え続けてきた男が、はじめて心のままに選び取る物語。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .point-section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }
  .point-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .point-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--lp-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lp-glass-border);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .point-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--lp-text-dim);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .point-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .point-section {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
